  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Uuuhh...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268055900487701
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Yuri looks toward Sayori on the floor, who despite having a gaping gash
      on her chest, is trying her darndest to use her magic to heal herself.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (... I have to do this, I have to do this, I have to do this...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268055900487702
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Despite Yuri still trying to psyche herself up, the draugr rudely interrupts
      her by swinging at her with his axe.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268055900487704
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Which Yuri manages to barely dodge out of the way of.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268055900487703
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Whether or not she's ready, the battle has found Yuri.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268055900487705
    - rid: 4351268055900487706
    - rid: 4351268055900487707
    - rid: 4351268055900487708
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Haaaahh...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268055900487769
    - rid: 4351268055900487771
    - rid: 4351268055900487772
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Sayori, are you okay?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268055900487773
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Guh...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268055900487774
    - rid: 4351268055900487775
    - rid: 4351268055900487778
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: My head still feels a little fuzzy...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268055900487779
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: But the bleeding's stopped! So that's good.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268055900487780
